   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n <title>Kaua'i Family Magazine - Fall 2026 Fun Family Happenings</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n <main role=\"main\">\n <header>\n <div class=\"title-fall\">\n <span>F</span><span>A</span><span>L</span><span>L</span>\n </div>\n <h1 class=\"title-main\">FUN FAMILY<br>HAPPENINGS</h1>\n </header>\n <div class=\"months-container\">\n <section class=\"month-august\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-august\">\n <h2 id=\"heading-august\">AUGUST</h2>\n <div class=\"events-grid\">\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Ultimate Trail Run</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-08-01T07:00\">Sat., Aug. 1, 7am</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Ōma'o Track</span><br>\n <a href=\"https://Ultimatehawaiiantrailrun.com\" itemprop=\"url\">Ultimatehawaiiantrailrun.com</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Heiva i Kaua'i</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-08-01\">Sat., Aug. 1</time> &amp; <time itemprop=\"endDate\" datetime=\"2026-08-02\">Sun., Aug. 2</time>, 9am-5pm<br>\n Tahitian Dance Competition<br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Kapa'a Beach Park</span><br>\n Food &amp; craft vendors<br>\n Admission $8; 12 &amp; under free<br>\n <a href=\"https://Heivakauai.com\" itemprop=\"url\">Heivakauai.com</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n </div>\n <div class=\"disclaimer\">\n Events are subject to change without notice. Always call event first to confirm.\n </div>\n </section>\n <section class=\"month-september\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-september\">\n <h2 id=\"heading-september\">SEPTEMBER</h2>\n <div class=\"events-grid\">\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Senior Fun Day</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-09-18T09:00\">Fri., Sept., 18, 9am-12pm</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Līhu'e Neighborhood Center</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Kaua'i Mokihana Festival</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-09-20\">Sept. 20-26</time><br>\n A week-long celebration of Hawaiian culture; education, music, &amp; hula competition<br>\n <a href=\"https://Maliefoundation.org\" itemprop=\"url\">Maliefoundation.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">International Peace Day</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-09-21T15:00\">Mon., Sept. 21, 3pm-7pm</time><br>\n Parade Walk from Sparky's Garden to Kaua'i Soto Zen's Kannon Peace Statue<br>\n <a href=\"https://KauaiSotoZen.com\" itemprop=\"url\">KauaiSotoZen.com</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Healthy Living Fall Celebration</h3>\n <p>\n <strong>CANCELED</strong>\n <span>Due to damage from Hurricane Lowell</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n </div>\n </section>\n <section class=\"month-october\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-october\">\n <h2 id=\"heading-october\">OCTOBER</h2>\n <div class=\"events-grid\">\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Kaua'i Annual Harvest Festival</h3>\n <p>\n <strong>CANCELED</strong>\n <span>Due to damage from Hurricane Lowell</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Grove Farm Crafts Fair &amp; Farmers Market</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-03T09:30\">Sat., Oct. 3, 9:30am-12:30pm</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Puhi Park</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Kaua'i Matsuri Festival</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-09\">Fri., Oct. 9</time>, Aloha Banquet<br>\n <time itemprop=\"endDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-10\">Sat., Oct. 10</time>, 9am-3pm<br>\n A Japanese Cultural Festival<br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Kaua'i War Memorial Convention Hall</span>-FREE<br>\n <a href=\"https://Kauaijcs.org\" itemprop=\"url\">Kauaijcs.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">26th KCA Annual Fall Festival</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-23\">Fri., Oct. 23</time> &amp; <time itemprop=\"endDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-24\">Sat., Oct. 24</time>, 4pm-8:30pm<br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Kaua'i Christian Academy</span><br>\n Family FUN in a carnival atmosphere!<br>\n Kīlauea<br>\n <a href=\"https://Kcaschool.org\" itemprop=\"url\">Kcaschool.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Walk to End Alzheimer's</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-24\">Sat., Oct. 24</time><br>\n Walk starts at 8:15am<br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Puakea Golf Course</span><br>\n <a href=\"mailto:someone@example.org\" itemprop=\"url\">someone@example.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Annual SMMH Keiki Halloween Parade</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T09:30\">Fri., Oct. 30, 930am-11:30am</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Kapa'a</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">KVMH Baby Halloween Parade</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-10-30T11:30\">Fri., Oct. 30, 11:30am-1pm</time><br>\n Front entry to <span itemprop=\"location\">KVMH Medical Office Building</span><br>\n Keiki 4 years of age and under\n </p>\n </article>\n </div>\n </section>\n <section class=\"month-november\" aria-labelledby=\"heading-november\">\n <h2 id=\"heading-november\">NOVEMBER</h2>\n <div class=\"events-grid\">\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Hanapēpē 's Biggest Little Carnival</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-11-07T10:00\">Sat., Nov. 7, 10am-6pm</time><br>\n <time itemprop=\"endDate\" datetime=\"2026-11-08T10:00\">Sun., Nov. 8, 10am-4pm</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Hanapēpē Stadium Park</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Veterans Day Ceremony</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-11-11T11:00\">Wed., Nov. 11, 11am</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Kaua'i Veterans Cemetery<br>Hanapēpē</span>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">Hawai'i Children's Theatre Presents: The Wizard of Oz</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-11-20\">Nov. 20-29</time><br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">War Memorial Convention Hall</span><br>\n <a href=\"https://Hctkauai.org\" itemprop=\"url\">Hctkauai.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n <article class=\"event-card\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Event\">\n <h3 itemprop=\"name\">5k Turkey Trot &amp; Shoot</h3>\n <p>\n <time itemprop=\"startDate\" datetime=\"2026-11-26T06:00\">Thurs., Nov. 26, 6am-9am</time><br>\n Thanksgiving Morning<br>\n <span itemprop=\"location\">Ocean Course Hokuala, Līhu'e</span><br>\n <a href=\"https://Kauaiturkeytrot.org\" itemprop=\"url\">Kauaiturkeytrot.org</a>\n </p>\n </article>\n </div>\n </section>\n </div>\n </main>\n</body></html>"
  }
